  "limitations": [
    "Greedy test roots are selected historical danger positions and include only three genuinely capped games. Results estimate error on the recorded streams. They do not test policy survival or represent fresh-game starts.",
    "Both calibration temperatures repeat the same four test streams. Their 2079 test positions belong to eight games, so positions are correlated. Genuine censoring is confined to the greedy pilot.",
